@using Molinos.Scato.Dominio.Enums
@using Molinos.Scato.Dominio.Seguridad
@using Molinos.Scato.Dominio.Recursos
@using Molinos.Scato.WebMobile.Seguridad

@{
    Layout = null;
}


<ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="myTab" role="tablist">
    <li class="nav-item ml-auto">
        <div class="nav-link nav-material bg-soja">Soja</div>
    </li>
    <li class="nav-item tagmaterial">
        <div class="nav-link nav-material bg-maiz text-white">Maiz</div>
    </li>
    <li class="nav-item tagmaterial">
        <div class="nav-link nav-material bg-naranja text-white">Trigo</div>
    </li>
    <li class="nav-item tagmaterial">
        <div class="nav-link nav-material bg-warning text-white">Girasol</div>
    </li>
</ul>
<div class="content">
    <div class="container-fluid">

        <div class="row row-card-no-pd" data-bind="foreach: CallesFiltradas('@((int)TipoCalle.Calado)')">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="sinbordetb row">
                    <div class="col sinbordetb">
                        <div class="card-stats sinbordetb">
                            <div class="card-body sinbordetb">
                                <p class="fw-bold mb-0 cart-title sinbordetb">
                                    <h4>
                                        <strong data-bind="text: Nombre">.</strong>
                                        @if (PermisosHelper.Is(PermisosScato.LlamadoDeFilasAutomatico))
                                        {
                                            <label class="switch">
                                                <input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: Automatica, click: LLamadoAutomatico, enable: MaterialId() && MaterialId() != '0'">
                                                <span data-id="a" class="slider round "></span>
                                            </label>
                                        }
                                    </h4>

                                </p>
                                <div class="row justify-content-md-center">
                                    @if (PermisosHelper.Is(PermisosScato.CambioDeMaterialEnFilas))
                                    {
                                        <div class="col-12" data-bind="foreach: $root.Materiales">
                                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" data-bind="attr: { id: $parent.Id + '-' + MaterialId, name: 'rcc'+$parent.Id, value: MaterialId}, checked: $parent.MaterialId,enable: !$parent.Automatica(), click: $parent.CambiarModo">
                                                <label class="form-check-label" data-bind="text: MaterialDesc, attr: { for: $parent.Id + '-' + MaterialId }"></label>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    }
                                    <div class="col-md-6">
                                        <button type="button" style="width: 100%" class="btn btn-warning btn-sm calle" disabled data-bind="visible: Automatica()"><strong>LLamado automático</strong></button>
                                        <button type="button" style="width: 100%" class="btn btn-success btn-sm calle" data-bind="click: LLamarSiguienteCalle, enable: MaterialId() && MaterialId() != '0', visible: !Automatica()"><strong>LLamar siguiente fila</strong></button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row row-card-no-pd" data-bind="foreach: $root.Materiales">
            <div class="col-md-12">
                <div class="sinbordetb row">
                    <div class="col sinbordetb">
                        <div class="card-stats sinbordetb">
                            <div class="card-body sinbordetb">
                                <p class="fw-bold mb-0 cart-title sinbordetb">
                                    <h4>
                                        <strong data-bind="text: MaterialDesc">.</strong>
                                    </h4>
                                </p>
                                <div class="row card-filas">
                                    <div class="col" data-bind="foreach: $root.CallesLLamadas('@((int)TipoCalle.PreCalado)', '@((int)TipoCalle.ReCalado)', '@((int)TipoCalle.Circular)', MaterialId)">
                                        <div class="text-white card-camion" data-bind="css: { 'bg-soja': MaterialId() == 4,
                                                                                                                            'bg-maiz': MaterialId() == 386,
                                                                                                                            'bg-naranja': MaterialId() == 13,
                                                                                                                            'bg-warning': MaterialId() == 5,
                                                                                                                            'bg-vacio' : MaterialId() == null
                                                                                                                             }">
                                            <div class="card-header text-center" style="padding: 0px; height: 18px;">
                                                <strong data-bind="text: (TipoCalle == @((int)TipoCalle.Circular) ? '&copy; ' : '') + Nombre +' (' + CamionesEnCalle() + ')'"></strong>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


<div id="cambioEstadoModal" class="modal fade" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-body form-horizontal">

                <div class="control-group">
                    @Html.Label("Motivo", new { @class = "control-label" })
                    <div class="controls">
                        @Html.TextArea("Motivo", new { id = "motivo", @class = "form-control", style = "width:350px;" })
                    </div>
                </div>

                <span id="error-largo" style="color:rgb(185, 74, 72); display:none;">@string.Format(Textos.Error_LargoMensaje, "Motivo", "10")</span>
            </div>

            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button id="dialogo-confirmar-cambio-modo" class="btn btn-success" name="submitAction">Confirmar</button>
                <button id="dialogo-confirmar-cancelar" data-dismiss="modal" class="btn btn-warning">Cancelar</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>